%% Omni-vite — Sequence: Discovery (map & list filtering)
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Verified Student
  participant W as Web App
  participant API as Discovery API
  participant DB as Database

  U->>W: Open dashboard
  W->>API: GET /events?categories=preferred&lat&lng
  API->>DB: Query PUBLISHED events in radius, matching categories
  DB-->>API: Candidate events
  API-->>W: Events sorted by distance
  W-->>U: Render map pins + list, both in sync

  U->>W: Toggle "student-run only", search "trivia"
  W->>API: GET /events?type=STUDENT_RUN&q=trivia
  API->>DB: Re-query with filters applied
  DB-->>API: Filtered results
  API-->>W: Updated, still distance-sorted
  W-->>U: Map and list update together
